{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-relics","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigRelic-33136","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-relics-item-ItemConfigRelic-33136-item-ItemConfigRelic-33136-0","text":"绿松陨石被埃维金人细细磋磨，又以金线翠缎穿之。他们说护身的纽结绝不应被黄沙埋没，而要璀璨得如同「卡卡瓦」之夜里自死亡中脱胎的神体。","speaker":""}]}
